<title>BRAZIL: Brazil court backs Telebras offer.</title>
<headline>Brazil court backs Telebras offer.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Brazilian court has ruled that a 1990 subscription offer by state telecom holding Telebras was valid, a court official said.</p>
<p>The court ruled that there was no evidence the offer had been detrimental to Telebras and its shareholders, as alleged by the Brazilian government.</p>
</text>
